Components_of_Land_Reforms_about:'<i class="fa fa-angle-double-right"></i>Detection & Vesting of Ceiling Surplus Land. <br /><i class="fa fa-angle-double-right"></i>Distribution of Vested lands among the landless peasants. <br /><i class="fa fa-angle-double-right"></i>Acquisition of Homestead land and its assignment among homeless rural poor. <br /><i class="fa fa-angle-double-right"></i>Providing protection to sharecroppers by recording their names. <br /><i class="fa fa-angle-double-right"></i>Continuous Maintenance & Updating of Record of Rights & Maps. <br /><i class="fa fa-angle-double-right"></i>Public Service for Record of Rights & Maps.',

