/*pripol_para:'This Portal & Jomir Tathya App does not automatically capture any specific personal information from you, (like name, phone number or e-mail address), that allows us to identify you individually.</br></br>If this Portal & Jomir Tathya App requests you to provide personal information, you will be informed for the particular purposes for which the information is gathered and adequate security measures will be taken to protect your personal information.</br></br>We do not sell or share any personally identifiable information volunteered on this site to any third party (public/private). Any information provided to this Portal will be protected from loss, misuse, unauthorized access or disclosure, alteration, or destruction. <br><br>If the official user wishes to delete the account, Please contact the department.',*/
pripol_para:'This Portal & Jomir Tathya App does not automatically capture any specific personal information from you, (like name, phone number or e-mail address), that allows us to identify you individually.</br></br>If this Portal & Jomir Tathya App requests you to provide personal information, you will be informed for the particular purposes for which the information is gathered and adequate security measures will be taken to protect your personal information.</br></br>We do not sell or share any personally identifiable information volunteered on this site to any third party (public/private). Any information provided to this Portal will be protected from loss, misuse, unauthorized access or disclosure, alteration, or destruction. <br><br>If the official user wishes to delete the account, Please contact the department.<br><br> <Strong>Use of Location and Camera Access</Strong><br><p>The <strong>Jomir Tathya App</strong> may access your device location (latitude and longitude) only when an authorized official user performs a field enquiry.</p><p>The location data is used solely to confirm that the enquiry is conducted from the correct field location.</p><p>The data is used only for official purposes and is not shared with any third party.</p><p>The <strong>Jomir Tathya App</strong> may also request camera access to capture field photographs during official enquiries.</p><p>These photos are used only for documentation or verification related to official land records.</p><p>The app does not access the camera in the background or collect any images without user action.</p><p>All captured images are securely transmitted to the department&#39;s server and are not shared externally.</p>',
