		Acts_and_Agreements_head:'Acts and Agreements',
		Acts_and_Agreements_body:'In order to carry-out the demarcation and related work jointly with Bangladesh, the following international, Acts, Agreements and Awards are followed :- <br/><br/> 1. Indian Independence Act, 1947 <br/>	2. Award of the Bengal Boundary Commission, 1947 [a.k.a. Radcliff Award] <br/> 3. Inter-Dominion Agreement of 1948 <br/> 4. Decision of the Indo-Pakistan Boundary Dispute Tribunal in 1950 [a.k.a. Bagge Award] <br/>	5. Nehru-Noon Agreement, 1958 <br/>	6. Minister Level Conference on Indo-East Pakistan Border Question in 1959 <br/> 7. Land Boundary Agreement, 1974 <br/>	8. Protocol 2011 to the LBA, 1974 <br/>	9. Different letters exchanged between Honerable Foreign Ministers and Foreign Secretaries of the two countries',
		Glimpses_of_recent_performances_and_achievements_head:'Glimpses of recent performances and achievements',
		Glimpses_of_recent_performances_and_achievements_body:'Here are some recent performances and achievements of IBBD, WB :- <br/><br/> 	1. Finalisation of list, maps and quantum of land of exchangeable 111 Indian Enclaves in Bangladesh and 51 Bangladesh Enclaves in India; exchange of enclaves was possible due this basework. <br/>	2. Finalisation of extent and quantum of adversely possessed land at the IB and preparation of related maps <br/> 3. Demarcation of, as per Protocol 2011, the parcels of adversely possessed land in the districts of Nadia, Malda and Jalpaiguri <br/> 4. Demarcation of, as per Protocol 2011, the un-demarcated patch of IB in Jalpaiguri <br/>	5. Signature of Strip Sheets by the Plenipotentiaries of both the countries <br/> 6. Supply of the finalised maps of enclaves and adverse-possession pockets to the settlement department for facilitation of preparation of land records <br/>	7. Maintenance of IB through reconstruction and repair of pillars at the entire Nagar River area in Dakshin Dinajpur <br/>	8. Maintenance of IB through reconstruction and repair of pillars at the Ichhamati River area in North 24 Parganas <br/> 9. Maintenance of IB through reconstruction and repair of pillars at the Mahananda River area in Phansidewa <br/> 10. Maintenance of IB through reconstruction and repair of pillars at the Sitalkuchi, Sitai, Dinhata-I, Dinhata-II and Tufanganj-I of Coochbehar',
		
